# Deploy only the static site and the server's traced source dependencies.
# Local credentials, test captures, reports, and QA tooling stay off Vercel.
/*
!dist
!api
!lib
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!vercel.json

# Never allow credentials or generated QA files nested inside an allowed folder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
